<title>UK: TENNIS-RESULT OF BOURNEMOUTH INTERNATIONAL OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULT OF BOURNEMOUTH INTERNATIONAL OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BOURNEMOUTH, England 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final at the Bournemouth International Open on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Alberto Costa (Spain) beat 8-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 6-7 (4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
